{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43212","headline":"送安养阎主簿还竹寺 · 林珝","name":"送安养阎主簿还竹寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分手怨河梁，南征历汉阳。\n江山追宋玉，云雨梦襄王。\n醉里宜城近，歌中郢路长。\n更寻栖枳处，犹是念仇香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林珝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}